Project scope
-------------

CreaGen Canvas is a self-hosted, multi-user AI creation canvas: node-based
generation workflows for image / video / LLM / audio with built-in durable
task queues, cost governance, and UI-configurable model provider channels.

Upstream inspiration
--------------------

This project is an independent implementation. Its canvas interaction
design draws inspiration from the following MIT-licensed projects (no code
copied):

- basketikun/infinite-canvas — https://github.com/basketikun/infinite-canvas
- glanderness/BeefTV — https://github.com/glanderness/BeefTV

Prior internal lineage
----------------------

